\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1.1}{\ignorespaces Transverse momentum distribution of each of four decayed electrons from 125~GeV Higgs boson. The distributions are attained using MC signal samples and shows at generator level within $\eta $ acceptance (empty histogram) and selected events (filled histogram) in four electron channel. \relax }}{2}{figure.caption.6}
